# Shell scripts must stay LF-only so they run on Linux / cloud agents
# (a CRLF shebang line yields "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M").
*.sh text eol=lf

# HFrEF ground-truth ledgers and fit source: keep BYTE-EXACT.
# hfref-union-ledger.jsonl carries a representation_hash PER DATUM, so any
# line-ending transform on checkout invalidates every one of them -- and it
# presents as a data-integrity failure, not as a checkout artefact.
# Measured 2026-08-30 without these rules: 724114 -> 724495 B (+381 = one per
# JSONL row), 204112 -> 204174 (+62), 36116 -> 36831 (+715 lines).
hfref-*.jsonl -text
hfref_eightcell_fit.R -text
